From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: alesx2io <96351978+alesx2io@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 18:07:59 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] dash: displayconfig: add smooth brightness ramps

Without per-display ramps the framework used config_brightness_ramp_rate_*,
which the overlay sets above the 0-255 scale, so every ramp was clamped
to 1.0/s and auto brightness jumped instead of fading.

Slow (auto) ramps: 0.15/s up, 0.10/s down, capped at 2s/3s.
Fast (manual) ramps: 0.6/s up, 0.5/s down.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../displayconfig/display_id_4627039422300187648.xml   | 10 ++++++++++
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+)

diff --git a/proprietary/vendor/etc/displayconfig/display_id_4627039422300187648.xml b/proprietary/vendor/etc/displayconfig/display_id_4627039422300187648.xml
index fed4272..5480674 100644
--- a/proprietary/vendor/etc/displayconfig/display_id_4627039422300187648.xml
+++ b/proprietary/vendor/etc/displayconfig/display_id_4627039422300187648.xml
@@ -57,6 +57,16 @@
             </point>
         </sdrHdrRatioMap>
     </highBrightnessMode>
+    <!-- Brightness ramps (perceptual brightness per second). Without them the framework falls
+         back to config_brightness_ramp_rate_*, which the overlay sets above the 0-255 scale, so
+         every change was clamped to 1.0/s and auto brightness jumped instead of fading.
+         Slow ramps are used by auto brightness, fast ones by manual changes. -->
+    <screenBrightnessRampFastDecrease>0.50</screenBrightnessRampFastDecrease>
+    <screenBrightnessRampFastIncrease>0.60</screenBrightnessRampFastIncrease>
+    <screenBrightnessRampSlowDecrease>0.10</screenBrightnessRampSlowDecrease>
+    <screenBrightnessRampSlowIncrease>0.15</screenBrightnessRampSlowIncrease>
+    <screenBrightnessRampIncreaseMaxMillis>2000</screenBrightnessRampIncreaseMaxMillis>
+    <screenBrightnessRampDecreaseMaxMillis>3000</screenBrightnessRampDecreaseMaxMillis>
     <ambientLightHorizonLong>1500</ambientLightHorizonLong>
     <ambientLightHorizonShort>1000</ambientLightHorizonShort>
     <!-- tsl2525_als reports integer lux: require more than 1 lux of change before
